# API Guidelines

This directory contains Azure Functions using the Node.js v4 programming model.

## Technology Stack

- **Runtime**: Node.js
- **Library**: `@azure/functions` (v4)

## File Structure

- `src/functions/*.js`: Individual function files.
- `index.js`: Entry point (usually empty or exports).

## Instructions

- The API is a proxy to the Xelflow Server Flow Engine.
- The API adds a layer of security to the Xelflow Server Flow Engine.
- Usally no extra functions are needed to run the Web application.
